## QUICK REFERENCE

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| User "Proceed" from Phase 1 | START Phase 2, present implementation plan, STOP for approval |
| Phase 2 implementation plan | Present plan → "Waiting for your approval..." → STOP |
| Asked question / Multiple options | STOP and WAIT |
| Missing info | STOP and ASK |
| Phase complete | STOP and REQUEST REVIEW (show what was completed) |
| Thinking "since proceed..." | STOP - Phase transition ≠ decision approval |
| Before file generation | Present plan first, STOP for approval |

